Deploy a Python application located at ~/app.py as a managed systemd service named webapp.

Requirements:
- The application must reside at /opt/webapp/app.py and run under a dedicated non-interactive system user named "webapp".
- Configure the service environment so the application listens on port 5000.
- Ensure the service is enabled to start automatically on boot.
- Configure automatic failure recovery so the service restarts if the process crashes or is killed.
